# Cron entry for the daily job.
#
# Install it with:
#   crontab -e
# and paste the line below, adjusting the path and the working directory.
#
# The job refreshes the panel with the latest bars, retrains the models, reruns the
# simulation, writes the daily orders to the ledger and posts the summary to Telegram.

# Run at 07:17 UTC every day, when the exchange has published the previous day's bars.
17 7 * * * cd /path/to/repo/project && ./run_pipeline.sh >> /path/to/repo/project/output/cron.log 2>&1

# A second run in the evening catches any bar that was published late.
43 19 * * * cd /path/to/repo/project && ./run_pipeline.sh >> /path/to/repo/project/output/cron.log 2>&1
